 <h3><u>Ek baar watan lot ke aaja</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Ek baar watan lot ke aaja</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <font size=4> <p>Isse pehle,</p> <p>Ke muje maut aajaye,</p> <p>Mere bhaya,</p> <p>Ali akber,</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p><br> sugra ki kasam hai tujhe akber</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Kya tujko gawaara hai ke mar jawoo tarap kar</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Aaja mein teri chand si soorat ki balaloo,</p> <p>Dulha na sahi mein tujhe dulha sa banaaloo,</p> <p>Dil mein hai jo armaan nikale teri khwahar,</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Bhabhi ke liye meine jo poshak banayi,</p> <p>Roti hu use dekh kar deti hu duhaee,</p> <p>Hai shaam-o-sahar ek sadaa mere labo par</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Kiya tujko meri yaad sataa ti nahi bhaya,</p> <p>Mein to tujhe ek pal bhi bhulati nahi bhaya,</p> <p>Kyu bhool gaya tu mujhe pardes mein jakar</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Kaano mein jo aawaz azan aati hein bhaya,</p> <p>tasweer teri dil mein utar jaati hai bhaya,</p> <p>roti hu ye kehkar ali akber ali akber</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Roti huye har eid guzari meri bhaya,</p> <p>Ati thi mujhe yaad tumhari mere bhaya,</p> <p>Yaado se hai abaad tere baad mera ghar</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Bimar tarap ti hai dawaa koi nahi hai,</p> <p>Is ghar mein udasi ke siwa koi nahi hai,</p> <p>Thakti bari yaad se diwaar kabhi gar</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Rukhkar ke suwe karbobela roti hu bhayi,</p> <p>Milne ki shabo roz duwa karti hu bhayi,</p> <p>Nana ki ziyarat ko taras ti hu baradar</p> <p>(Ek baar watan lot ke aaja) x2</p> <p>Tum bin mai jiyu ye koi aasan nahi hai,</p> <p>Hoga tera phir koi armaan nahi hai,</p> <p>Hoga ye tera aakhri ehsan bahan par</p></font>
